---

<section class="section" id="founder">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="founder-card" data-animate>
      <div class="founder-photo">
        <img src="/boris.jpg" alt="Boris Karulin" width="160" height="160" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="founder-body">
        <blockquote>
          <p>
            I feel that there's huge demand for AI integration for those who are
            not deep in tech but still run a successful business.
          </p>
          <p>
            If you think that our service is right for you but still in doubt,
            you can ask me directly via
            <a href="https://wa.me/18626628281" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a> or
            <a href="https://t.me/+18626628281" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Telegram</a>.
          </p>
          <p class="founder-note">
            I don't consult via these means – if you are eager to start with us,
            please <a href="#booking">book the intro call</a> or
            <a href="mailto:hey@smbuddy.co">contact via email</a>.
          </p>
        </blockquote>
        <div class="founder-name">
          <strong>Boris Karulin</strong>
          <span>Founder, SMBuddy</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder-card {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    padding: var(--space-2xl);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  }

  .founder-photo {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .founder-photo img {
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .founder-body {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  blockquote {
    margin: 0;
  }

  blockquote p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  blockquote p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .founder-note {
    font-size: 0.875rem !important;
    color: var(--text-tertiary) !important;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  blockquote a {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  blockquote a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-teal);
  }

  .founder-name {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .founder-name strong {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .founder-name span {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .founder-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: var(--space-xl);
    }

    .founder-photo img {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
    }

    .founder-name {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
